2. Document Intelligence Pipeline

Documents cannot simply be thrown into a vector database.

Document
   ↓
classification
   ↓
text/table extraction
   ↓
layout understanding
   ↓
metadata extraction
   ↓
financial entity extraction
   ↓
semantic chunking
   ↓
embedding
   ↓
vector index

The system extracts things like:
Revenue
EBITDA
Net Income
Current Assets
Current Liabilities
Debt
Cash
Receivables
Inventory
Operating Cash Flow

Tables require separate handling from narrative text.

This lets you demonstrate Document AI, rather than just PDF → chunks → embeddings.







Document
   ↓
Deterministic parser
   ↓
Quality checks
   ↓
Good enough? ── Yes ──> continue pipeline
   │
   No
   ↓
Advanced extraction
OCR / layout model / multimodal LLM
   ↓
Validation
   ↓
Normalized ContentBlock


